{"id": "moses-lake-capstone", "status": "published", "category": "Special 專案", "title": "Moses Lake Capstone 專案", "subtitle": "可回收容器的數位分身、模擬與 AI 決策支援。", "cover": {"src": "/assets/experience/cover-moses-lake-capstone.png", "width": 164, "height": 136, "fit": "contain", "background": "#0d0d11", "srcset": ""}, "html": "<div class=\"note-resources\"><a href=\"https://mobius-capstone-aim3nxv8wdviukvqvw32st.streamlit.app/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">開啟供應鏈庫存追蹤模型<span aria-hidden=\"true\"> ↗</span></a></div><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>從容器追蹤走向資產配置決策</h3><p>2026 年 1 月至 5 月，我們團隊以 Supply Chain Project Consultant（Capstone）的角色，參與 Moses Lake Industries 的供應鏈專案，開發可回收桶槽與容器的 AI 決策支援原型。</p><p>專案在不新增 RFID 或 GPS 硬體的條件下，結合數位分身、模擬與作業研究方法，探索如何在需求不確定時配置可回收資產、提高利用率，並降低缺貨風險。</p></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>把需求與物流變動放進 What-if 模擬</h3><p>儀表板將累計出貨、EWMA 趨勢預測與每日產品出貨量放在同一個介面，並提供需求變動與物流延遲的情境控制。使用者可以比較不同假設對運輸與資產循環指標的影響，將出貨資訊轉換為配置決策的依據。</p><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-what-if-overview.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-what-if-overview.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/moses-lake-what-if-overview-d891eb198072-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/moses-lake-what-if-overview-d891eb198072-843.webp 843w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"需求與物流延遲的 What-if 模擬介面，呈現累計出貨、EWMA 趨勢與每日產品出貨量。\" width=\"843\" height=\"575\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>需求與物流延遲的 What-if 模擬介面，呈現累計出貨、EWMA 趨勢與每日產品出貨量。</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>用序號串起每一個容器的循環</h3><p>序號追蹤介面將資產狀態拆成庫存、運往客戶、客戶端停留與返回等階段，並呈現製造日期、循環進度與預計回收時間。總覽清單則支援依產品、客戶、狀態及專案設定的合規分類篩選，讓個別容器與整體資產池能在同一套原型中檢視。</p><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-serial-detail.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-serial-detail.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/moses-lake-serial-detail-1d88c7d0ee28-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/moses-lake-serial-detail-1d88c7d0ee28-840.webp 840w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"單一容器的序號追蹤畫面，呈現客戶、製造日期、循環階段與預計回收時間。\" width=\"840\" height=\"419\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>單一容器的序號追蹤畫面，呈現客戶、製造日期、循環階段與預計回收時間。</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-return-status.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-return-status.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/moses-lake-return-status-487242a09b85-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/moses-lake-return-status-487242a09b85-845.webp 845w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"可回收容器的狀態總覽與序號清單，可依狀態、產品、客戶及合規分類篩選。\" width=\"845\" height=\"438\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>可回收容器的狀態總覽與序號清單，可依狀態、產品、客戶及合規分類篩選。</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>從客戶停留時間到整體資產流向</h3><p>客戶層級的微型模擬把需求、實際停留時間與文件中的循環時間放在一起，觀察指定配置下的可用容器數量如何隨時間變化。這讓資產配置可以進一步考慮不同客戶的需求與回收節奏。</p><p>Sankey 圖則將整體資產池、專案中的合規分類，以及可用、在途與客戶端資產的流向視覺化。畫面中的合規判定沿用原型設定，不作為法規結論。</p><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-customer-simulation.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-customer-simulation.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/moses-lake-customer-simulation-16bf90be82f3-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/moses-lake-customer-simulation-16bf90be82f3-845.webp 845w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"客戶層級的需求與停留時間分析，以及專屬容器配置的可用量模擬。\" width=\"845\" height=\"367\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>客戶層級的需求與停留時間分析，以及專屬容器配置的可用量模擬。</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-fleet-lifecycle.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-fleet-lifecycle.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/moses-lake-fleet-lifecycle-5940de82bf5a-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/moses-lake-fleet-lifecycle-5940de82bf5a-849.webp 849w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"資產生命週期的 Sankey 流向圖；合規標籤依原型中的專案條件呈現。\" width=\"849\" height=\"555\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>資產生命週期的 Sankey 流向圖；合規標籤依原型中的專案條件呈現。</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>讓 AI 參與情境分析</h3><p>我們團隊透過 API 串接 AI 決策支援，讓使用者能以自然語言詢問需求、物流與政策變動的影響。截圖以假設的 20% 出口關稅為題，展示 AI 如何根據當時的儀表板資訊提出後續模擬、客戶溝通與資產重新配置的建議。</p><p>這些回覆是原型中的情境分析輸出；它們本身不等於已完成模擬、已執行建議或已驗證的政策影響。</p><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-ai-recommendations.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-ai-recommendations.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/moses-lake-ai-recommendations-1091a5beb841-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/moses-lake-ai-recommendations-1091a5beb841-838.webp 838w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"AI 對假設關稅情境提出的模擬與資產配置建議，屬原型輸出。\" width=\"838\" height=\"532\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>AI 對假設關稅情境提出的模擬與資產配置建議，屬原型輸出。</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-ai-scenario-chat.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-ai-scenario-chat.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/moses-lake-ai-scenario-chat-fb4fe5c9f3bf-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/moses-lake-ai-scenario-chat-fb4fe5c9f3bf-846.webp 846w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"以假設 20% 出口關稅提問的 AI 對話；畫面不代表實際政策或已完成的影響估算。\" width=\"846\" height=\"537\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>以假設 20% 出口關稅提問的 AI 對話；畫面不代表實際政策或已完成的影響估算。</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>技術實作與模型成果</h3><p>技術工作包括以 Python 與 SQL 處理資料、設計 ETL 流程與模組化架構，並把數位分身、模擬與 AI 決策支援整合成可展示的系統原型。</p><p>專案模型估算的營運資金節省潛力約為 5%（約 $1.5M），並在模擬中改善資產利用率與服務可靠度。這些屬於模型與模擬結果，尚不代表企業已實現的財務節省。</p><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-simulation-dashboard.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-simulation-dashboard.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/moses-lake-simulation-dashboard-361b7c8eb010-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/moses-lake-simulation-dashboard-361b7c8eb010-838.webp 838w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"What-if 儀表板補充截圖，保留需求、物流與資產循環指標的整體視圖。\" width=\"838\" height=\"577\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>What-if 儀表板補充截圖，保留需求、物流與資產循環指標的整體視圖。</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>團隊合作與公開展示</h3><p>沒有團隊的合作，這個專案不可能完成。感謝每一位團隊夥伴的投入與協作，也感謝教授在專案過程中的指導與支持。從開會討論到商學院公開 Showcase，這是大家共同完成的成果。</p><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-team-meeting.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-team-meeting.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/moses-lake-team-meeting-947f48550e25-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/moses-lake-team-meeting-947f48550e25-960.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"Moses Lake Capstone 專案的線上開會與合作紀錄。\" width=\"2802\" height=\"1544\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>Moses Lake Capstone 專案的線上開會與合作紀錄。</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-business-school-showcase.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-business-school-showcase.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/moses-lake-business-school-showcase-c144f9483a12-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/moses-lake-business-school-showcase-c144f9483a12-748.webp 748w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"團隊在商學院公開 Showcase 展示 Moses Lake Capstone 專案成果。\" width=\"748\" height=\"577\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>團隊在商學院公開 Showcase 展示 Moses Lake Capstone 專案成果。</figcaption></figure></div></section><p class=\"case-note\">系統介面截圖為專案原型與模擬展示。</p>", "pending": "完整文章準備中。", "close": "關閉"}